stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Admitted: owner turn admits A (head verdict) and B behind it
    Admitted --> Noted: A was the sole head of an idle owner / ⏳, record + persisted mark
    Admitted --> Admitted: cancel before the note / nothing recorded yet
    Noted --> Accepted: recheck custody / ⏳ cleared if A already left
    Noted --> Noted: cancel / queue exit clears the recorded ⏳
    Accepted --> Settled: drive finds no front (cancelled)
    Accepted --> Handing: owner grants A
    Handing --> Returned: start (fresh attempt, no add, B merged) or exit (held or gone)
    Returned --> Settled: handoff settle / ⏳ → 📬 while held, ⏳ removed when gone
    Admitted --> Accepted: restart, input replays
    Returned --> Accepted: restart before the settle, input still held
    Returned --> Settled: restart, input gone or dropped by boot / boot sweep clears the persisted mark
